# Mistmeadow Skulk, "protection from mana value 3 or greater" (CR 702.16, 202.3): protection from a quality of the source's mana value,
# with the limit at exactly 3. On turn 2 Bot2 cannot target it with Dismember (mana value 3), though Lightning Strike (mana value
# 2) can, and does on turn 8 (the control, which kills it). On turn 3 the Skulk attacks and the Mirran Crusader (mana value 3)
# may not block it, though the Ornithopter (mana value 0) may (the control). On turn 6 the Crusader (double strike 2/2) attacks and
# the Skulk (1/1) blocks it: all of its damage is prevented, in both damage steps (it would have died), while the Skulk's
# lifelink damage is dealt (Bot1 22). On turn 7 Bot1's Loxodon Warhammer (mana value 3) can't be equipped to it, while the
# Basilisk Collar (mana value 1) can (the control).

